This extension adds Age of Mythology: Retold modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Xbox[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Save (UserGames) mods with a ".mythsav" file install to the "%USERPROFILE%\Games\Age of Mythology Retold\<User ID>\savegames" folder.[/*]
[*]Config (UserGames) mods with a ".xml" file install to the "%USERPROFILE%\Games\Age of Mythology Retold\<User ID>\users" folder.[/*]
[*]ReShade mods with a "reshade-shaders" folder install to the game folder.[/*]
[*]Binaries / Root Game Folder mods with a ".dll" or ".ini" file install to the game folder.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[*][b][color=#b6d7a8][size=2]You must enable mods in the in-game Mod Manager to be loaded by the game.[/size][/color][/b][/*]
[*][b][size=2]Includes mod types for config and save files[/size][/b][/*]
[/list]

[b]📝 Notes for Mod Authors:[/b]
[spoiler]
Packaging rules for Age of Mythology: Retold mods, so Vortex installs them to the right place.

Vortex decides what a mod is by looking at the files and folders inside the archive. It tries each installer in order and the first one that matches wins, so archive layout is what determines where your mod ends up.

========================================================================

Save Game Files:

Save files, deployed to the game's save folder.

  Requirements:
    - Recognised by any file with the ".mythsav" extension.

  Installs to: "%USERPROFILE%\Games\Age of Mythology Retold\<User ID>\savegames"

  Common mistakes:
    - Including an example save alongside a normal mod makes the archive install as a save.

========================================================================

Config File Mods:

Configuration tweaks, deployed to the game's config location.

  Requirements:
    - Recognised by any file with the ".xml" extension.

  Installs to: "%USERPROFILE%\Games\Age of Mythology Retold\<User ID>\users"

  Common mistakes:
    - Shipping a config file with one of these names inside an unrelated mod makes the whole archive install as a config mod.

========================================================================

Reshade:

Recognised when the archive contains a "reshade-shaders" folder.

  Installs to: the game folder

========================================================================

Binaries / Root Game Folder:

Recognised when the archive contains a ".dll" or ".ini" file.

  Installs to: the game folder

========================================================================

Rules That Apply To Every Mod Type:

    - Folder and file name matching is case-insensitive.
    - Extra wrapper folders around a recognised folder are generally fine; the installer searches at any depth.
[/spoiler]

