[b][color=#ea9999]Mod Authors[/color]:[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Get support for modding this game at the [url=https://forums.ageofempires.com/c/age-of-mythology/retold-modding/447]Age of Mythology Retold Modding Forum[/url]﻿.[/b]
[*][b]Tool for extracting game resources - [url=https://forums.ageofempires.com/t/v-0-7-resource-manager-age-of-myth-retold-bar-extractor/260136]Resource Manager[/url]﻿[/b]
[*][b]You must package your data mods to match the game's folder structure. For example, a modified "Data.bar" file would be packaged in folders like this: "game&#92;data&#92;Data_mods.bar". This is the same pattern for mod's uploaded to Microsoft's "World's Edge" program.[/b]
[/list]

